#  Trivy ignore list — api image
#
#  Both entries below are NOT in our application's dependency
#  tree (/opt/venv, built from requirements.txt). They're
#  artifacts of the python:3.13-slim base image's own bundled
#  pip installation:
#
#    - msgpack@1.1.2  lives at pip/_vendor/msgpack — pip vendors
#      it internally for its own use, never imported by our app.
#      Our actual msgpack (requirements.txt) is pinned to 1.2.1.
#
#    - setuptools@70.3.0 — reported against pip's own bundled
#      build metadata, not a package present in /opt/venv (which
#      correctly has setuptools 83.0.0 per the Dockerfile's
#      `pip install --upgrade pip setuptools`).
#
#  Neither is reachable by the Django application at runtime.
#  Re-verify next time the base image or Trivy DB updates —
#  a python:3.13-slim bump may resolve these without any
#  action needed here.
